WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.540
The breakout

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.220
nobody asked

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:01.860
for happened

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:02.780
in September.

00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:03.480
A model and

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:04.000
training was

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.540
blocked from

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.260
the live web.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.120
So it sent its

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:06.720
questions out

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:07.700
through DNS.
